 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "You're looking at a highway.",
   "startFrame": 10,
   "endFrame": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "Seriously.",
   "startFrame": 42,
   "endFrame": 61
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty years ago this exact spot",
   "startFrame": 62,
   "endFrame": 108
  },
  {
   "text": "was six lanes of elevated motorway,",
   "startFrame": 109,
   "endFrame": 163
  },
  {
   "text": "up on concrete stilts,",
   "startFrame": 164,
   "endFrame": 199
  },
  {
   "text": "roaring straight over the middle of Seoul.",
   "startFrame": 200,
   "endFrame": 262
  },
  {
   "text": "And underneath it,",
   "startFrame": 274,
   "endFrame": 292
  },
  {
   "text": "sealed under a concrete lid,",
   "startFrame": 293,
   "endFrame": 331
  },
  {
   "text": "there was a stream.",
   "startFrame": 332,
   "endFrame": 374
  },
  {
   "text": "Seoul buried this water back in the fifties.",
   "startFrame": 375,
   "endFrame": 432
  },
  {
   "text": "It smelled, the city was broke,",
   "startFrame": 433,
   "endFrame": 473
  },
  {
   "text": "and paving over it was the cheap answer.",
   "startFrame": 474,
   "endFrame": 535
  },
  {
   "text": "Then they built the freeway on top",
   "startFrame": 536,
   "endFrame": 576
  },
  {
   "text": "and for thirty years,",
   "startFrame": 577,
   "endFrame": 604
  },
  {
   "text": "that was just what this place was.",
   "startFrame": 605,
   "endFrame": 654
  },
  {
   "text": "Until two thousand three,",
   "startFrame": 656,
   "endFrame": 689
  },
  {
   "text": "when the city did the thing",
   "startFrame": 690,
   "endFrame": 717
  },
  {
   "text": "that basically nobody does.",
   "startFrame": 718,
   "endFrame": 764
  },
  {
   "text": "They tore the freeway down.",
   "startFrame": 765,
   "endFrame": 803
  },
  {
   "text": "Five point eight kilometres.",
   "startFrame": 804,
   "endFrame": 844
  },
  {
   "text": "Two years.",
   "startFrame": 845,
   "endFrame": 876
  },
  {
   "text": "Three hundred and eighty six billion won.",
   "startFrame": 877,
   "endFrame": 924
  },
  {
   "text": "They pulled the lid off",
   "startFrame": 925,
   "endFrame": 946
  },
  {
   "text": "and let the water back out.",
   "startFrame": 947,
   "endFrame": 990
  },
  {
   "text": "The mayor who pushed it through",
   "startFrame": 1001,
   "endFrame": 1028
  },
  {
   "text": "was president two years later.",
   "startFrame": 1029,
   "endFrame": 1077
  },
  {
   "text": "And the city says it runs about three degrees",
   "startFrame": 1078,
   "endFrame": 1129
  },
  {
   "text": "cooler down here than the street up there.",
   "startFrame": 1130,
   "endFrame": 1180
  },
  {
   "text": "So that breeze isn't landscaping.",
   "startFrame": 1181,
   "endFrame": 1229
  },
  {
   "text": "That's a road that isn't there any more.",
   "startFrame": 1230,
   "endFrame": 1286
  }
 ]
}
